{"id": "60366", "title": "弥足深陷", "author": "夜之祭", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 11, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/60/60366.htm", "intro": "属性分类：古代／宫廷江湖／强攻强受／虐心\r\n\r\n他，有倾国之颜，无意间被当今圣上看重，并深受宠爱。\r\n然而所有甜蜜全是包裹在外面的糖纸，一旦撕破，里面是令人措手不及的罪恶以及痛苦。\r\n步步经营，却也一步步地走进了圣上的温柔陷阱，无法自拔", "base": "files/article/html/60/60366", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "8858091.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "8858094.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "8858096.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "8858098.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "8858099.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "8858102.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "8858104.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "8858105.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "8858107.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "8858109.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "8858111.html", "available": false}]}